  speakerName: Miller
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Have A Pen
    paragraphs:
    - I heard from the Lumberjack the path to the barn has been cleared...   {freezePlayer}
    - It is a little worse for wear... but also a nice secluded place, distant from
      the nightmares of the fog.
    - Perfect for raising livestock...
    - Here... Something to get you started... {giveGift}
    - This animal pen can house larger sized critters in your barn. Without a home,
      critters will run away at dawn...
    - 'While you get that set up, I will see if I can wrangle up a hog for ya...  '
    - Consider it a house warming gift...
    emotions: 05000000020000000000000001000000020000000000000001000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: 
    paragraphs:
    - Bleh! Something NEW please?
    emotions: 03000000
  paths:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - ...
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Make Room
    paragraphs:
    - Good day to you Mr.Farmer...
    - Before I proceed... Would you mind clearing some space in your pockets...?
    emotions: 0000000004000000
  - pathName: All Done
    paragraphs:
    - Looks like your new friend is all settled in...
    - Truffle hogs are a delightful companion... Each day they will search your farm
      for valuable truffles... The more friendly they are, the more likely they are
      to find them.
    - Just dont mind the burrows...
    - Anyways, my business here is done... Come see me by my home in the morning...
      I carry essentials for animal husbandry...
    - Take care...
    emotions: 0100000001000000020000000000000000000000
